common case this skill targets. Real precedent: traefik/hub-doc's
"## Gateway v3.20.6 & v3.19.11" entry (2026-07-01).

For a SINGLE tag, drop this down to: one version in the heading (no " & "),
one date, no "vX.Y.Z only:"/"vX.Y.Z:" prefixes on any bullet (every bullet is
shared by definition), one Traefik Proxy line in Misc, and one table in the
Collapse instead of two. Don't leave prefixes in when there's nothing to
disambiguate.

